            "value": "4x USB 2.0 (Rear)4x USB 2.0 (Front)1x USB 5Gbps Type A (Rear)4x USB 5Gbps Type A (Front)1x USB 5Gbps Type C (Front)1x USB 10Gbps Type A (Rear)2x USB 10Gbps Type C (Rear)"
